See also Fig. <a href="#A4.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ D.1 Additional Qualitative Results for Image and Video Frame Interpolation ‣ Appendix D Additional Results ‣ Be Tangential to Manifold: Discovering Riemannian Metric for Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> in Appendix <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Additional Results ‣ Be Tangential to Manifold: Discovering Riemannian Metric for Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a>.
</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
