<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Examples of interpolated image sequences.
The leftmost and rightmost images are the given endpoints <math id="A4.F5.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{0}^{\scriptscriptstyle(0)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo maxsize="0.710em" minsize="0.710em">(</mo><mn mathsize="0.710em">0</mn><mo maxsize="0.710em" minsize="0.710em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{0}^{\scriptscriptstyle(0)}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A4.F5.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{0}^{\scriptscriptstyle(1)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo maxsize="0.710em" minsize="0.710em">(</mo><mn mathsize="0.710em">1</mn><mo maxsize="0.710em" minsize="0.710em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{0}^{\scriptscriptstyle(1)}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the middle images are the interpolated results <math id="A4.F5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\hat{x}_{0}^{\scriptscriptstyle(u)}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo maxsize="0.710em" minsize="0.710em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">u</mi><mo maxsize="0.710em" minsize="0.710em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\hat{x}_{0}^{\scriptscriptstyle(u)}\}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A4.F5.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure>
