<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Use of Large Language Models.</h2>

<div id="Ax1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We used ChatGPT and GitHub Copilot as autocomplete tools in polishing the manuscript and implementing the experimental code.
No large language models were used for research ideation.</p>
</div>
